mintcam (0.2.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Packaging fixes after the first lintian run:
    - do not ship the website source (index.html) in the Debian source
      package, it is not needed to build the package and lintian flagged it
      with source-is-missing
    - debian/copyright: separate stanza for mintcam.appdata.xml carrying its
      CC0-1.0 metadata license, which fixes the appstream metadata license
      mismatch warning
    - Standards-Version 4.6.2, the version lintian in noble knows

 -- Alex Mirici <jeaders@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:30:00 +0200

