mintcam (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Features: live preview, photo capture, video recording with audio,
    RTMP streaming, QR scanner, focus assist, face auto-framing,
    time-lapse, motion detection, background blur (Bokeh), preset
    manager, digital zoom, social sharing, and dark theme UI.

